    },
    "pvp": {
      "en": "Elite Skill. For 5...37...45 seconds, your Binding Rituals cost 15 less Energy (minimum 5) and recharge 25...45...50% faster. Soul Twisting ends after 1...3...3 Binding Ritual[s].",
      "zhTW": "持續 5～45 秒，縛靈儀式能量消耗減少 15（最低 5），冷卻速度加快 25～50%。使用 1～3 次縛靈儀式後終止；PvP 版不會立即恢復儀式。"
    }
